# Sandbox (predicate execution) internals are kept OUT of the public repo on purpose:
# not exposing the exact sandbox/hardening architecture is an extra layer of defense.
# Everything under sandbox/ is local-only; see docs for the public-facing contract.
sandbox/
# Local-only compose override (e.g. Pi sandbox socket wiring); never commit.
docker-compose.override.yml

# Declarative principals config holds Messenger PSIDs — keep local (example is committed)
config/principals.yaml
